        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Balaki yarumana Balaarmu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaana baIsiraeli nibachenda, nibakhupa ikambi mumuhololookhwe kwaMoabu injelekha waYorodani eYeriko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Balaki waZipori yalola kosi aka Isiraeli yali nakholeele abaAmori. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne Moabu yaria abandu abo muno shichila bali abanji; ne Moabu nafwa omwoyo khulwa abaana baIsiraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho Moabu nasunjila abakofu baMidiani ari Omukanda kuno kulakhomba biosi ebikhubotokhaane kubimale, shinga ing'ombe olwa yikhomba obunyasi obwomubwayilo. Ne Balaki waZipori yali omuruchi waMoabu mundaalo etsio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye narumila Balaamu waBeori abarume, ePetsori, ahambi nOmwalo okwo, mushialo shiabaana baAmau namulanga, ari Lola, luliho oluyia lwabandu olurulile muMisiri; lola, bamaamile khushialo shiosi, nibamenya ahahengaane ninasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khulwako ekhusaaya mbu witse bulaano, unaamile abandu bano eshilaamo shiobubii; okhuba bayombile amaani. Mana haundi khulanyala okhubahula, khubeelusie mushialo; okhuba emanyile mbu owa osabila ikhabi aheebwa ikhabi, ne owa olaama eshilaamo shiobubii, aba mushilaamo shiobubii ario.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana abakofu baMoabu nabakofu baMidiani nibarulaho nibali nende emirungo chiobulakusi mumakhono; nibatsiila Balaamu, nibamuboolela amakhuwa kaBalaki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye nabakalusia ari Mulakona hano, ne nemukalusie likhuwa shinga OMWAMI olwa nayamboolele. Kho abakhulundu baMoabu nibakonaho ewaBalaamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne OMWAMI namwitsila Balaamu nareeba mbu Nabandu shiina bano aba oli nibabo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balaamu namukalusia Nyasaye ari Balaki waZipori, omuruchi waMoabu, arumile abandu ababoola mbu ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lola, oluyia lwabandu olurulile muMisiri lumaamile khushialo shiosi; kho bulaano witse undachile eshilaka munwa abandu bano; haundi ndalanyala okhubaseera nimbeelusia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Nyasaye namusunjila Balaamu ari Oratsia ninabo ta; oralaama abandu abo eshilaamo shiobubii ta; shichila nabeikhabi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iiho Balaamu yahachila okhubuukha, nasunjila abakhuundu baBalaki ari Kalushe mushialo shieenywe; okhuba OMWAMI yangaaniye oburatsia nineenywe ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abakhulundu baMoabu nibarula, nibatsia ewaBalaki, nibaboola bari Balaamu alobile okhwitsa nineefwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Balaki yaruma abakhulundu bandi khandi, ababashila obunji khandi oluyali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabo niboola ewaBalaamu, nibamusunjila mbu Balaki waZipori aboola ari Ekhusaaya, orafuchiilila likhuwa liosi likhuyinjile oburoola ewa endi ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhuba ndalakhwemekha muluyali olukhongo muno; kata elia umboolela liosi ndalakhola; khulwako ekhusaaya mbu witse undachile abandu bano eshilaka munwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Balaamu nakalusia nasunjila abasumba baBalaki ari Kata Balaki niyakhamba inzuye niyiitsuule tsifeetsa nende tsitsahaabu, shindakhanyala okhubira likhuwa liOMWAMI Nyasaye wanje, okhukhola akashilaho kata akaleema tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khulwako emusaaya mbu neenyu mwesi mukone hano, emanye aka OMWAMI alameeta okhumboolela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne OMWAMI namwitsila Balaamu mushilo, namusunjila ari Abandu abo nibaba nibeetsile okhukhulanga, rula otsie ninabo; nebutswa likhuwa liene elia nekhuboolele, nilio lionyene elia olakhola.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Malaika, nende isishili yaBalaamu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho nibushieele Balaamu yabuukha, niyaala eshiokhwikhalakhwo khusishiliye, natsia nabakhulundu baMoabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne oburima bwaNyasaye bwakha khulwa okhutsiakhwe; naye malaika w nasinjila khunjila okhumwikalila. Ne yali nachendanga nali khusishiliye, nali nende abasumbabe babili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nayo isishili niyilola malaika w nasinjiile khunjila, natsomoole olukangalwe nalutiilile mumukhono; isishili niyiibera okhurula khunjila niyinjila mumukunda; naye Balaamu nakhupa isishili, okhuchikalusia khunjila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana malaika w nasinjila khunjila inyelele eyali hakari wemikunda chiemitsabibu, omushingachi nikuli elubeka eyi, khandi omushingachi kundi elubeka eyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nayo isishili niyilola malaika w, niyiihachilisia khumushingachi, niyiseenelesilia eshilenje shiaBalaamu khumushingachi; naye nachikhupa khandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iiho malaika w natsiililila hambeli, nasinjila habundu hatiiyikhu aha obwiyango bwabula okhukotola okhutsia khumukhono o nusaatsa kata khumukhono omukhasi ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isishili niyilola malaika w, niyikona bukona, Balaamu nali khuyo; ne oburima bwaBalaamu nibwakha, nakhupa isishili nomutiichilokwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana OMWAMI niyeekula omunwa kweisishili, nayo niyisunjila Balaamu mbu Nasi ekhukholeele shiina, eshichila niukhupa khandi khataru orio? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balzamu nakalusia nssunjia isishili ari Shichila umbayilakhwo; shiamba olukanga lwaba mumukhono kwanje; khane ndakhakhwira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isishili niyisunjila Balazmu yili Nasi shindi isishiliyo, eya wachendelanga tsindaalo tsiosi tsiobulamubwo okhuula okva leelo? Ndayinyanga okhukhukholela endio noho? Naye ari Ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana OMWAMI namulabia Balaamu tsimoni, naye nalola malaika w nasinjiile khunjila, natsomoole olukangalwe nalutiilile mumukhono; nabunamia omurwe, nasikama niyeenama hasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Malaika w namureeba ari Nishiina eshichilile nokhupa isishiliyo khandi khataru orio? Lola, erulile ninzitsa okhukhwikalila, shichila injilayo neikhayikhanu imbeli wanje. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nayo isishili yinduutsi, niyiibera imbeli wanje khataru yirio; khane niyirakheeberile okhurulakhwo, khane okhwira ndakhakhwirile, nayo ndakhachihonokosiye yibe mwoyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho Balaamu nasunjila malaika w ari Enzonoonile; okhuba shimanyilenje shinga olwa osinjiile khunjila okhunzikalila ta. Kho bulaano, nikaba nikarakhuchamisia ta, ndalafunya ewa erulile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye malaika w naboolela Balaamu ari Otsie nabandu bano; nebutswa likhuwa liene elia nekhuboolele, nilio lionyene elia olaboola. Kho Balaamu natsiililila halala nabakhulundu baBalaki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Balaamu naBalaki",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne olwa Balaki yahulila mbu Balaamu witsile, yarula natsia okhumwakaanila okhuula khwitookho liaMoabu, elili khulwakho lwaArinoni, khushihesi shiolwakho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balaki namusunjila Balaamu ari Shindarumile abandu okhukhulanga? Ne mbushiina noranzitsila ta? Shindi isie owakhanyala okhukhwemekha muluyali? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balaamu nakalusia, nasunjila Balaki ari Lola, enzitsile; ne bulaano endikhwo nobunyali bwosi bwosi okhukhuboolela likhuwa noho? Lisungo liene elia Nyasaye alara mumunwa kwanje, nilio elia ndalaboola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Balaamu natsia nende Balaki, niboola eKiriatsi-huzotsi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Balaki namala emisango chietsing'ombe namakondi, naruma ewaBalaamu nende abakhulundu aba yali ninabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
